### create → 201 Item
# @name createItem
POST {{host}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "test"}

### list → 200 Item[]（直前の create が含まれる）
GET {{host}}/items

### get → 200 Item（直前の create）
GET {{host}}/items/{{createItem.response.body.id}}

### get (missing) → 404 Problem type=/problems/not-found
GET {{host}}/items/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

### get (not uuid) → 400 Problem type=/problems/validation-failed
GET {{host}}/items/not-a-uuid

### create (empty title) → 400 Problem type=/problems/validation-failed
POST {{host}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": ""}

### create (not json) → 400 Problem type=/problems/validation-failed
POST {{host}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

not json
